. do 12b_gic_stacked.do 

. * 12b_gic_stacked.do : stacked (pooled) version of the group-specific income 
> regressions
. * One system: ln(avg pretax income of group g)_{ct} on group x ln GACI_max, g
> roup x ln pop,
. * country#group FE, year#group FE, country-clustered SE. Feyrer IV = group x 
> (a_t x ln MA_1996).
. * Adds (i) joint Wald test that decile elasticities are equal, (ii) top-minus
> -bottom contrast,
. * (iii) linear-rank trend of the elasticity across deciles.
